    {
      "id": "ulZA",
      "code_hash": "6f3ce3fcee564e3477e16862de07b5f8",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><div class=\"language-python codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">os</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sys</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">filename</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"nb\">open</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">os</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">join</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;/home&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;/fichier.txt&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n</code></pre></div></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ecfG",
      "code_hash": "20f04eb5a4da554e5e2a8951bae624ce",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Ici, il y a deux probl\u00e8mes. Le module <code>sys</code> est import\u00e9 alors qu'il n'est pas utilis\u00e9 \u00e0 un seul moment. Ensuite, nous avons effectu\u00e9 plusieurs importations de modules diff\u00e9rents sur la m\u00eame ligne, ce qui n'est pas autoris\u00e9 par PEP 8.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "Pvdt",
      "code_hash": "392e542fb56b4cec6b0c0faf77663e75",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><div class=\"language-py codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">os</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sys</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">filename</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"nb\">open</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">os</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">join</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;/home&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;/fichier.txt&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n<span class=\"n\">sys</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">exit</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n</code></pre></div></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ZBYS",
      "code_hash": "d7eecd8ef1ece0292764beb446065e31",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">L\u00e0-aussi, les erreurs ont \u00e9t\u00e9 corrig\u00e9es.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Dans certains cas, il est aussi possible d'exclurer certaines erreurs ou avertissements en invoquant le param\u00e8tre <code>--ignore</code>. Par exemple, si nous supposons que des importations sur la m\u00eame ligne sont autoris\u00e9es, nous pouvons exclurer l'erreur associ\u00e9e, \u00e0 savoir <code>E401</code>.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "aLJB",
      "code_hash": "6f3ce3fcee564e3477e16862de07b5f8",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><div class=\"language-python codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">os</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">sys</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">filename</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"nb\">open</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">os</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">path</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">join</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s2\">&quot;/home&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"s2\">&quot;/fichier.txt&quot;</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n</code></pre></div></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "nHfw",
